{"id":70521,"date":"2026-10-23T09:00:04","date_gmt":"2026-10-23T08:00:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70521"},"modified":"2026-10-23T09:02:28","modified_gmt":"2026-10-23T08:02:28","slug":"vortex-december-vila-real-de-santo-antonio","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vortex-december-vila-real-de-santo-antonio\/","title":{"rendered":"Vortex December 2026 Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Vortex December 2026 Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Vortex December 2026 Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio<\/strong> realiza-se nos dias <strong>12 e 13 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado e domingo), no <strong>Complexo Desportivo de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Faro<\/strong>). Com capacidade para 5000 pessoas neste centro de alto rendimento do sotavento algarvio, o evento re\u00fane atletas de todos os n\u00edveis numa celebra\u00e7\u00e3o de corrida h\u00edbrida e fitness funcional.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza 23 categorias distribu\u00eddas por tr\u00eas programas de <strong>8 rondas<\/strong>: a <strong>Full Race Standard<\/strong> (7x 800 m de corrida alternados com 1000 m SkiErg, 50 m Sled Push, 80 m Burpee Broad Jump, 1000 m Row, 200 m Farmers Carry, 100 m Sandbag Lunges, 100 reps Wall Balls e sprint final de 200 m, em Solo, Doubles ou Relay), a <strong>Adult Sprint<\/strong> (dist\u00e2ncias reduzidas a metade com 7x 400 m de corrida em Solo ou Doubles) e o programa <strong>VORTEX Kids &#038; Kid + Parent Combo<\/strong> (dos 8 aos 15 anos, com corridas de 200 m ou 400 m e pesos adaptados).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>VORTEX Hybrid Games<\/strong>, o evento conta com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip em cada esta\u00e7\u00e3o funcional, publica\u00e7\u00e3o de resultados no pr\u00f3prio dia, pontua\u00e7\u00e3o para o ranking de gin\u00e1sios (Battle of the Gyms) e transfer\u00eancia gratuita de titularidade at\u00e9 7 dias antes da prova. Descobre tamb\u00e9m <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/o-que-e-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">o que \u00e9 o HYROX<\/a> e consulta o calend\u00e1rio completo de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-hyrox\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Provas HYROX<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 a 13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Complexo Desportivo de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio, Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio, Faro<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; l