 style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox \/ Fitness Racing<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Full Race Standard (Solo, Doubles &#038; Relay)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 a 13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Hyrox \/ Fitness Racing<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Adult Sprint (Sprint Solo &#038; Sprint Doubles)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 a 13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids \/ Funcional<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">VORTEX Kids &#038; Kid + Parent Combo (8\u201315 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 a 13 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Kids:<\/strong> 49,99 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (8-10, 11-13 e 14-15 anos)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Vortex December 2026 Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no fim de semana de 12 e 13 de dezembro de 2026 (s\u00e1bado e domingo), no Complexo Desportivo de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio, um centro de alto rendimento desportivo no leste do Algarve (distrito de Faro) com capacidade de arena para 5000 pessoas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os formatos e categorias dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Existem tr\u00eas programas de 8 rondas: Full Race Standard (a partir dos 16 anos, em Solo, Doubles ou Relay, com 7x 800 m de corrida + 7 esta\u00e7\u00f5es + sprint de 200 m), Adult Sprint (Sprint Solo e Sprint Doubles, com 7x 400 m de corrida e volumes reduzidos nas esta\u00e7\u00f5es) e VORTEX Kids (Kids Solo, Kids Doubles e Kid + Parent Combo para jovens dos 8\u201310, 11\u201313 e 14\u201315 anos).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as 8 esta\u00e7\u00f5es do formato Full Race Standard?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As sete primeiras rondas come\u00e7am com 800 m de corrida seguidos de: 1. SkiErg (1000 m), 2. Sled Push (50 m \u2014 152 kg M\/Misto, 102 kg F), 3. Burpee Broad Jump (80 m), 4. Row (1000 m), 5. Farmers Carry (200 m \u2014 2&#215;24 kg M\/Misto, 2&#215;16 kg F), 6. Sandbag Lunges (100 m \u2014 20 kg M\/Misto, 10 kg F) e 7. Wall Balls (100 reps \u2014 6 kg M, 4 kg F). A 8\u00aa ronda \u00e9 um sprint final de 200 m at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e dos bilhetes de espectador?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es come\u00e7am a partir de 49,99 \u20ac (IVA inclu\u00eddo, com transfer\u00eancia gratuita de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 7 dias antes do evento). Os bilhetes di\u00e1rios de espectador custam 4,98 \u20ac para maiores de 13 anos, sendo a entrada gratuita para crian\u00e7as com menos de 13 anos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os regulamentos oficiais (Rulebooks) de cada categoria?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os livros de regras oficiais da VORTEX Hybrid Games (Rulebook National Solo, Doubles e Relay) podem ser consultados e descarregados em PDF na p\u00e1gina oficial do evento e atrav\u00e9s do bot\u00e3o de regulamento dispon\u00edvel nesta ficha t\u00e9cnica.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Vortex December 2026 Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\